  "post_content": "<p>Esta tarde de martes se ha celebrado por las calles del centro hist&oacute;rico de Onda m&aacute;s cercanas a la&nbsp;del Sant&iacute;simo Salvador la procesi&oacute;n organizada por los vecinos en honor al patr&oacute;n de de la ciudad.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/08/DSC022741.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 321px\" /></p>\n<p>La comitiva estuvo acompa&ntilde;ada en todo momento por la Charanga Marcha Cha y, una vez finalizada la procesi&oacute;n, se devolvi&oacute; la imagen del Sant&iacute;simo Salvador a su hornacina.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02201.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02217.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02218.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02225.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02226.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02227.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02228.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02229.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02265.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02266.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02273.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02274.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02285.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02302.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02305.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02318.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02321.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoelsalvador/dsc02338.jpg\" alt=\"SONY DSC\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
